msgid "The installer cannot be closed while it is modifying the target disk."
msgstr "L'installateur ne peut pas être fermé pendant qu'il modifie le disque cible."

#: src/main.py:133
msgid "Continue Installation"
msgstr "Continuer l'installation"

#: src/pages.py:69
msgid "Guided coexistence requires a system booted in UEFI mode and a GPT target disk. This disk cannot continue in guided mode."
msgstr "Guided coexistence requires a system booted in UEFI mode and a GPT target disk. This disk cannot continue in guided mode."

#: src/pages.py:73
msgid "The complete partition map and free-space geometry could not be read consistently. No space on this disk is authorized for installation."
msgstr "The complete partition map and free-space geometry could not be read consistently. No space on this disk is authorized for installation."

#: src/pages.py:78
msgid "The GPT disk or one of its partitions has no unique stable identifier. Guided coexistence cannot safely authorize preservation or writes on this disk."
msgstr "The GPT disk or one of its partitions has no unique stable identifier. Guided coexistence cannot safely authorize preservation or writes on this disk."

#: src/pages.py:83
msgid "This disk contains an active mapper, array or other nested block-device topology that guided coexistence does not support."
msgstr "This disk contains an active mapper, array or other nested block-device topology that guided coexistence does not support."

#: src/pages.py:87
msgid "A partition on this disk is mounted. Unmount it and rescan storage before continuing."
msgstr "A partition on this disk is mounted. Unmount it and rescan storage before continuing."

#: src/pages.py:91
msgid "AnduinOS will use only the selected unallocated space. The installer will not shrink or move an existing filesystem."
msgstr "AnduinOS will use only the selected unallocated space. The installer will not shrink or move an existing filesystem."

#: src/pages.py:95
msgid "Existing Windows, recovery and data partitions remain outside the write set and will be preserved."
msgstr "Existing Windows, recovery and data partitions remain outside the write set and will be preserved."

#: src/pages.py:99
msgid "The existing EFI System Partition is only a candidate. Health and free-space checks must pass before it can be reused, and it will never be formatted."
msgstr "The existing EFI System Partition is only a candidate. Health and free-space checks must pass before it can be reused, and it will never be formatted."

#: src/pages.py:104
msgid "BitLocker storage will be preserved. The installer will not unlock, resize, repair or otherwise modify it."
msgstr "BitLocker storage will be preserved. The installer will not unlock, resize, repair or otherwise modify it."

#: src/pages.py:108
msgid "The installer will not mount, repair or infer the safety of Windows volumes from hibernation or Fast Startup state. Any required Windows maintenance must be completed in Windows."
msgstr "The installer will not mount, repair or infer the safety of Windows volumes from hibernation or Fast Startup state. Any required Windows maintenance must be completed in Windows."

#: src/pages.py:113
msgid "Alternatively, you may explicitly select one entire partition to erase. Everything in that selected partition will be destroyed; it is never selected automatically."
msgstr "Alternatively, you may explicitly select one entire partition to erase. Everything in that selected partition will be destroyed; it is never selected automatically."

#: src/pages.py:118
msgid "Installation cannot continue with this selection. There is no force-continue option around storage safety checks."
msgstr "Installation cannot continue with this selection. There is no force-continue option around storage safety checks."

#: src/pages.py:122
msgid "After changing partitions or unmounting a volume, rescan storage and select the target again."
msgstr "After changing partitions or unmounting a volume, rescan storage and select the target again."

#: src/pages.py:128
msgid "No suitable unallocated space was found. To protect your data, create unallocated space with Windows Disk Management, then boot the installer again and rescan the disk."
msgstr "No suitable unallocated space was found. To protect your data, create unallocated space with Windows Disk Management, then boot the installer again and rescan the disk."

#: src/pages.py:133
msgid "No suitable unallocated space was found. To protect your data, create unallocated space with a partitioning tool, then boot the installer again and rescan the disk."
msgstr "No suitable unallocated space was found. To protect your data, create unallocated space with a partitioning tool, then boot the installer again and rescan the disk."

